{"id":"000SXD","title":"RS-Bahn (3) (Region Sums U-Bahn)","author":"cyddrdrd","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":5,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-06T23:14:41+00:00","posted":"Heute, 00:00 Uhr","rules":"I have been thinking about creating a 9x9 RS-Bahn for nearly a year and finally it's here! This is the third (and the most difficult) puzzle in the RS-Bahn series. I strongly recommend trying previous puzzles in this series (which can be found here and here) to get more familiar with this ruleset and its implications. Estimated difficulty is around 4.5-5. Feel free to reach out on Discord (@cyddrdrd) or leave a hidden comment if you'd like a hint. Enjoy!\n\nRules\n\n• Sudoku: Fill the grid with digits 1-9, so that no digit repeats in the same row, column, or 3×3 box.\n\n• U-Bahn (with empty clues): Draw a totally connected network through the centers of some cells in the grid. The network may branch or turn, but may not have any dead ends. Clues outside the grid indicate how many times the corresponding line shape (empty cell, cross, branch, straight line, or turn) appears in that row/column, regardless of rotation.\n\n• Region Sum Lines: Box borders divide the network into segments with the same sum.\n\nThank you 72kchunshuai and Christounet for testing and suggestions!\n\nPenpa+\n\nSudokuPad","solutionCode":"For each row except the last, from top to bottom, the number of lines leading down from that row; followed by column 2. (17 digits in total)","tags":["Sudoku","U-Bahn","Region Sum Lines (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://tinyurl.com/nhakvdp2","kind":"short"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/b8g85k4ood","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/b8g85k4ood","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":14,"cols":14,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-06T23:14:41+00:00"}